  dialogueList:
  - id: ouch
    text: Great, you are here. The simulation will read your movements, try walking.
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 5
  - id: glad
    text: Everything seems good
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 5
  - id: enemy
    text: Look, critters. Dumb things for sure. Get close to get rid of them!
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 5
  - id: seeds
    text: Yo! SEEDS! Gab 'em while they are still fresh! We'll use them later.
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 5
  - id: base
    text: Do you see that? Pretend it's a base. Be sure to protect it. For now just
      sow the four plots for seed production.
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 8
  - id: wait
    text: Damn, waiting is boring. Let the enemeis come.
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 5
  - id: turret
    text: Those things were not messing around. Plant a turret to ensure we don't
      get overrun.
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 8
  - id: vine
    text: Things are looking good, but plant a vine in the way to slow those things.
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 8
  - id: bomber
    text: Oh no, here comes a big one... Get all your seeds and blast 'em!
    hasTriggered: 0
    lifeTime: 8
